{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "17812807",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Evolution of Heuristics (EoH) — Demo\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook demonstrates the full EoH workflow:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Create an agent** backed by a local LLM (llama.cpp or vLLM)\n",
    "2. **Define a problem** satisfying `ProblemAPI`\n",
    "3. **Configure `EvalSpec`** — problem + training instances + metaheuristic\n",
    "4. **Configure `EoHConfig`** — population size, generations, strategy, budgets\n",
    "5. **Run `run_eoh()`** — evolve heuristics over the specified generations\n",
    "6. **Inspect results** — best individual, hall-of-fame, convergence history\n",
    "\n",
    "The problem used here is the `SphereProblem` (minimise $\\sum x_i^2$), which is\n",
    "small and fast — useful for verifying the pipeline before applying EoH to real tasks."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "957fc104",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Working directory: /data/back_home/baseline/foreblocks/agent\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "import sys\n",
    "import json\n",
    "import random\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "\n",
    "# Make sure we can import the local src package\n",
    "ROOT = Path(\".\").resolve()\n",
    "if str(ROOT) not in sys.path:\n",
    "    sys.path.insert(0, str(ROOT))\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Working directory:\", ROOT)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "dc2de0f8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Create the Agent\n",
    "\n",
    "`create_agent()` wraps the LLM backend and all tool/skill infrastructure.\n",
    "Point `llm_url` at your running llama.cpp or vLLM server."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "765abacd",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Agent ready: Agent\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "from src.agent.factory import create_agent\n",
    "\n",
    "LLM_URL = \"http://localhost:8080\"   # ← change to your endpoint\n",
    "\n",
    "agent = create_agent(\n",
    "    llm_url=LLM_URL,\n",
    "    use_chat_api=True,\n",
    "    chat_template=\"chatml\",\n",
    "    db_path=\"/tmp/eoh_demo_sessions.db\",\n",
    "    embedding_model=None,           # disable RAG for speed\n",
    "    config_overrides={\n",
    "        \"temperature\": 0.7,\n",
    "        \"max_tokens\": 1600,\n",
    "        \"max_iterations\": 1,        # EoH manages its own loop; keep agent passes minimal\n",
    "    },\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Agent ready:\", type(agent).__name__)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a591199f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Define the Problem\n",
    "\n",
    "We use the built-in `SphereProblem` (continuous minimisation).\n",
    "Any class that implements the `ProblemAPI` protocol works here."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "2a4eb785",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Problem : SphereProblem  sense=min  dim=12\n",
      "Train   : 12 instances\n",
      "Valid   : 6 instances\n",
      "\n",
      "API description (injected into LLM prompts):\n",
      "ProblemAPI:\n",
      "  - problem.sense is \"min\" or \"max\"\n",
      "  - problem.random_solution(instance, rng) -> solution\n",
      "  - problem.objective(solution, instance) -> float\n",
      "  - problem.is_feasible(solution, instance) -> bool\n",
      "  - optional: problem.repair(solution, instance, rng) -> solution\n",
      "  - optional: problem.move_neighborhood(solution, instance, rng) -> move\n",
      "  - optional: problem.apply_move(solution, move, instance, rng) -> solution\n",
      "\n",
      "MetaheuristicAPI (used in evaluation):\n",
      "  - metaheuristic.run(problem, instance, hooks, budget, rng) -> RunTrace\n",
      "\n",
      "Your heuristic must output build_hooks()->dict with any subset of:\n",
      "  init_solution / propose_move / apply_move / accept_move / update_params / restart\n",
      "\n",
      "GA conventions:\n",
      "  - propose_move() may return {\"op\":\"mutate\", ...} or {\"op\":\"crossover\",\"mate\":sol,...}.\n",
      "  - apply_move() should understand the move object you emit.\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "from src.eoh.examples.sphere import SphereProblem, make_sphere_instances, example_api_desc\n",
    "\n",
    "DIM   = 12      # search-space dimensionality\n",
    "BOUND = 5.0     # coordinate bounds [-5, 5]\n",
    "\n",
    "problem = SphereProblem(dim=DIM, bound=BOUND)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Training instances (seen during evolution)\n",
    "train_instances = make_sphere_instances(n=12, dim=DIM, bound=BOUND)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Validation instances (held-out; used for final scoring only)\n",
    "valid_instances = make_sphere_instances(n=6,  dim=DIM, bound=BOUND)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Problem : {problem.__class__.__name__}  sense={problem.sense}  dim={DIM}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Train   : {len(train_instances)} instances\")\n",
    "print(f\"Valid   : {len(valid_instances)} instances\")\n",
    "print()\n",
    "print(\"API description (injected into LLM prompts):\")\n",
    "print(example_api_desc())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "900a0006",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Build the `EvalSpec`\n",
    "\n",
    "`EvalSpec` groups the problem, its instances, and the metaheuristic driver.\n",
    "Leaving `metaheuristic=None` lets EoH default to its built-in Genetic Algorithm."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "60cc2f7c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Metaheuristic: ga\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "from src.eoh.evaluation import EvalSpec\n",
    "from src.eoh.metaheuristics.ga import GeneticAlgorithm, GAConfig\n",
    "\n",
    "ga = GeneticAlgorithm(GAConfig(pop_size=24))\n",
    "\n",
    "eval_spec = EvalSpec(\n",
    "    problem=problem,\n",
    "    instances_train=train_instances,\n",
    "    instances_valid=valid_instances,\n",
    "    metaheuristic=ga,\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Metaheuristic:\", ga.name)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "30d805db",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Configure EoH\n",
    "\n",
    "Key knobs:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Parameter | Meaning |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| `pop_size` | Individuals in the population |\n",
    "| `elite_k` | Top-k kept every generation |\n",
    "| `offspring_per_gen` | New individuals created per generation |\n",
    "| `generations` | Number of evolution rounds |\n",
    "| `strategy` | `\"e1\"` (mutation/crossover) or `\"e2\"` (self-improve) |\n",
    "| `progressive` | Stage evaluations (cheap → full) to discard bad candidates early |\n",
    "| `stage_instances` | How many training instances per stage |\n",
    "| `stage_budgets` | Budget per instance per stage |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "b5e794a9",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "EoHConfig(pop_size=8, elite_k=3, offspring_per_gen=8, generations=5, strategy='e1', representation='thought+code', tournament_k=4, crossover_rate=0.35, temperature=0.7, max_tokens=1400, enforce_markers=True, allow_code_only_fallback=True, max_code_chars=16000, llm_retries=2, reformat_retries=1, new_session_per_call=True, agent_verbose=False, agent_use_semantic=False, max_parent_code_in_prompt=7000, max_parent_thought_in_prompt=1800, max_exemplar_code_in_prompt=4500, max_exemplar_thought_in_prompt=1200, cache_enabled=True, prompt_cache_enabled=True, progressive=True, stage_budgets=(Budget(max_iters=60, max_time_s=0.1), Budget(max_iters=140, max_time_s=0.22)), stage_instances=(3, 8), parallel_eval=False, max_workers=0, w_mean=1.0, w_cvar=0.3, cvar_alpha=0.25, w_feas=0.8, w_time=0.15, infeas_quality_penalty=1000000000000.0)\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "from src.eoh.models import EoHConfig\n",
    "from src.eoh.types import Budget\n",
    "\n",
    "cfg = EoHConfig(\n",
    "    # Population\n",
    "    pop_size=8,\n",
    "    elite_k=3,\n",
    "    offspring_per_gen=8,\n",
    "    generations=5,           # increase for real runs (15–30)\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Search strategy\n",
    "    strategy=\"e1\",            # \"e1\": mutation + crossover\n",
    "    representation=\"thought+code\",\n",
    "    crossover_rate=0.35,\n",
    "\n",
    "    # LLM sampling\n",
    "    temperature=0.7,\n",
    "    max_tokens=1400,\n",
    "    new_session_per_call=True,\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Progressive evaluation (cheap stage first, full stage only for survivors)\n",
    "    progressive=True,\n",
    "    stage_instances=(3, 8),\n",
    "    stage_budgets=(\n",
    "        Budget(max_iters=60,  max_time_s=0.10),   # fast screening\n",
    "        Budget(max_iters=140, max_time_s=0.22),   # full evaluation\n",
    "    ),\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Fitness weights\n",
    "    w_mean=1.0,\n",
    "    w_cvar=0.3,\n",
    "    w_feas=0.8,\n",
    "    w_time=0.15,\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Caching (avoids re-querying the LLM for identical prompts)\n",
    "    cache_enabled=True,\n",
    "    prompt_cache_enabled=True,\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Parallelism\n",
    "    parallel_eval=False,      # set True and max_workers>0 to parallelise eval\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(cfg)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "acd1bb5c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Run EoH\n",
    "\n",
    "`run_eoh()` temporarily replaces the agent's system prompt with the EoH system\n",
    "prompt, runs `EoHEngine.evolve()`, then restores it."
   ]
  },
